#: .\templates\landing\about.html:5
msgid "About Us - CattleCare AI"
msgstr "Nezvedu - CattleCare AI"

#: .\templates\landing\about.html:192
msgid "About CattleCare AI"
msgstr "Nezve CattleCare AI"

#: .\templates\landing\about.html:193
msgid ""
"We combine artificial intelligence and veterinary expertise to protect "
"cattle and support Zimbabwean farmers."
msgstr ""
"Tinosanganisa hucherechedzo hwemashine uye unyanzvi hwekutarisira mhuka "
"kuchengetedza mombe uye kushandira varimi veZimbabwe."

#: .\templates\landing\about.html:200
msgid "Our Mission & Vision"
msgstr "Zvatinoda Kuita & Chitarisiro Chedu"

#: .\templates\landing\about.html:201
msgid ""
"CattleCare AI was built to reduce livestock losses and improve animal health "
"through early disease detection and timely veterinary support."
msgstr ""
"CattleCare AI yakavakwa kuti ideredze kurasika kwemhuka uye kusimudzira "
"utano hwemhuka nekutarisa zvirwere kare uye kubatsirwa kwedokotela wemhuka "
"nguva yakakodzera."

#: .\templates\landing\about.html:206
msgid "Mission"
msgstr "Chinangwa"

#: .\templates\landing\about.html:207
msgid ""
"To empower every farmer in Zimbabwe with AI-powered early disease prediction "
"and instant access to qualified veterinarians, so that cattle health is "
"protected and livelihoods are secured."
msgstr ""
"Kupa simba varimi vose muZimbabwe nekutaura zvirwere nekuchenjera kweAI uye "
"kusvika kumashure kune vatariri vemhuka vakadzidza, kuti utano hwemombe "
"huchengetedzwe uye hupenyu hwunochengetwa."

#: .\templates\landing\about.html:213
msgid "Vision"
msgstr "Chitarisiro"

#: .\templates\landing\about.html:214
msgid ""
"A Zimbabwe where no farmer loses cattle to preventable diseases because of "
"late detection or lack of veterinary care. We aim to be the national "
"platform for livestock health intelligence."
msgstr ""
"Zimbabwe ine varimi vasingarasi mombe kune zvirwere zvinogona kudzivirirwa "
"nekuda kwekutariswa kwakukurumidza kana kusava nedokotela wemhuka. Tinoda "
"kuva ndima yemunyika yehuchenjeri hweutano hwemhuka."

#: .\templates\landing\about.html:220
msgid "Values"
msgstr "Tsika"

#: .\templates\landing\about.html:221
msgid ""
"Accuracy, accessibility, and trust. We use robust machine learning models, "
"keep the platform available 24/7, and work with Ministry-approved vets so "
"farmers get reliable support."
msgstr ""
"Chokwadi, kuwanikwa, nekuvimbika. Tinoshandisa mamodeli akasimba ekudzidza "
"kwemuchina, tinochemera nzvimbo inowanikwa 24/7, uye tinoshanda nevatariri "
"vemhuka vakabvumidzwa neHurumende kuti varimi vawane rubatsiro rwakavimbika."

#: .\templates\landing\about.html:231
msgid "Why CattleCare AI?"
msgstr "Nei CattleCare AI?"

#: .\templates\landing\about.html:232
msgid ""
"Livestock is central to many Zimbabwean families. Disease outbreaks can wipe "
"out herds and income. We built this system to change that."
msgstr ""
"Mhuka dziri pakati pemhuri dzakawanda eZimbabwe. Kubuda kwezvirwere kunogona "
"kuparadza mhomho uye mari. Takavaka sisitimu iyi kuchinja izvozvo."

