"farmers with Ministry-approved vets, supports remote consultation, and helps "
"vets prioritize critical cases."
msgstr ""
"Varimi vemumaruwa kazhinji havana nzira nyore yekusvika kuna dokotela "
"wemhuka. CattleCare AI inobatanidza varimi neveti vakabvumidzwa neMinistry, "
"inopa rubatsiro rwekubvunzana kure, uye inobatsira veti kuisa pakutanga "
"nyaya dzinokosha."

