#: .\templates\landing\services.html:5
msgid "Our Services - CattleCare AI"
msgstr "Zviitwa zvedu - CattleCare AI"

#: .\templates\landing\services.html:189
msgid ""
"AI-powered disease prediction, treatment guidance, and veterinary connection—"
"all in one platform for Zimbabwean farmers."
msgstr ""
"Kutarisa zvirwere kweAI, kuratidza kurapa, uye kubatana neveti—zvose pane "
"imwe ndima kune varimi veZimbabwe."

#: .\templates\landing\services.html:196
msgid "What We Offer"
msgstr "Zvatinoita"

#: .\templates\landing\services.html:197
msgid ""
"From symptom-based prediction to vet assignment and ministry analytics, we "
"cover the full spectrum of livestock health support."
msgstr ""
"Kubva pakutarisa kusinganyanyi zviratidzo kusvika pakuisa veti uye ongororo "
"yeMinistry, tinoita rubatsiro rwose rweutano hwemhuka."

#: .\templates\landing\services.html:203
msgid ""
"Enter the symptoms you see in your cattle. Our machine learning models "
"(including Naive Bayes and Random Forest) analyze them and predict the most "
"likely disease with high accuracy."
msgstr ""
"Isa zviratidzo zvauona mumombe yako. Mamodhi edu ekudzidza kwemashini "
"(anosanganisira Naive Bayes uye Random Forest) anoatarisa uye anozivisa "
"chirwere chingangodiwa nezve kururama kwakakwirira."

#: .\templates\landing\services.html:204
msgid "Fast, free, and available 24/7 from any device."
msgstr "Nokukurumidza, mahara, uye kuwanikwa nguva dzose kubva pamudziyo wose."

#: .\templates\landing\services.html:211
msgid ""
"Get instant, tailored treatment suggestions, quarantine steps, and "
"preventive measures. Recommendations are aligned with common cattle diseases "
"and best practices."
msgstr ""
"Wana mazano ekurapa akagadziridzirwa, nhanho dzekuchengetwa, uye nzira "
"dzekudzivirira nokukurumidza. Mazano akangana nezvirwere zvemombe "
"zvinonyanya uye nzira dzakanaka."

#: .\templates\landing\services.html:212
msgid "Reduce guesswork and act with confidence."
msgstr "Deredza kufunga pasina ruzivo uye ita nechivimbo."

#: .\templates\landing\services.html:219
msgid ""
"For severe or critical cases, we connect you with Ministry-approved "
"veterinarians. Choose from vets in your province, see distance, and request "
"consultation."
msgstr ""
"Kune nyaya dzakakomba kana dzinokosha, tinokubatanidza nevadokotela vemhuka "
"vakabvumidzwa neMinistry. Sarudza kubva kuveti mumurovha wako, ona "
"chinhambwe, uye kumbira kubvunzana."

#: .\templates\landing\services.html:220
msgid "Verified vets, transparent assignment."
msgstr "Veti vakasimbiswa, kuisa kwakajeka."

#: .\templates\landing\services.html:227
msgid ""
"Real-time disease outbreak monitoring and analytics for the Ministry of "
"Agriculture. Track trends by province, plan vaccinations, and support "
"national livestock policy."
msgstr ""
"Kutarisa kubuda kwezvirwere nguva yacho uye ongororo kune Munisitiri "
"weZembe. Tevedzera zvakajairika mumurovha, ronga maBhakisini, uye simbisa "
"mutemo wemhuka wenyika."

#: .\templates\landing\services.html:228
msgid "Maps, reports, and exportable data."
msgstr "Mapu, mireporiti, uye ruzivo runogona kubviswa."

#: .\templates\landing\services.html:235
msgid ""
"Your farm and case data are stored securely. We follow best practices for "
"data protection and comply with local policies so you can use the platform "
"with confidence."
msgstr ""
"Ruzivo rwepurazi uye nyaya rwako rwakachengetwa zvakanaka. Titevedza nzira "
"dzakanakisa dzekuchengetedza ruzivo uye titevedza mitemo yenzvimbo kuitira "
"kuti ushandise ndima nechivimbo."

#: .\templates\landing\services.html:236
msgid "Encrypted and access-controlled."
msgstr "Yakavharwa uye yakasimbiswa pakupinda."

#: .\templates\landing\services.html:243
msgid ""
"Submit cases and get predictions anytime. No need to wait for office hours "
"or travel long distances. Especially valuable in remote or rural areas."
msgstr ""
"Tumira nyaya uye uwane zvitarisiro nguva dzose. Hakuda kumirira nguva "
"dzemahofisi kana kufamba nzira refu. Inokosha zvikuru munzvimbo dziri kure "
"kana dzemaruwa."

#: .\templates\landing\services.html:244
msgid "Always on, from phone or computer."
msgstr "Nguva dzose, kubva foni kana kompyuta."

#: .\templates\landing\services.html:255
msgid "Four simple steps from symptom to solution."
msgstr "Nhanho nhatu nyore kubva kuzviratidzo kusvika pakubudiswa."

#: .\templates\landing\services.html:255
msgid "See full guide →"
msgstr "Ona chiratidzo chizere →"

#: .\templates\landing\services.html:260
msgid "1. Report Symptoms"
msgstr "1. Rondedzera Zviratidzo"

#: .\templates\landing\services.html:261
msgid ""
"Register as a farmer, then describe the symptoms you see in your cattle "
"through our guided form."
msgstr ""
"Nyoresa semurimi, wotsanangura zviratidzo zvauona mumombe yako nefomo redu "
"rinoratidza nzira."

#: .\templates\landing\services.html:267
msgid "2. AI Analysis"
msgstr "2. Ongororo yeAI"

#: .\templates\landing\services.html:268
msgid ""
"Our models analyze the symptoms and return a disease prediction with a "
"confidence score."
msgstr ""
"Mamodhi edu anotarisa zviratidzo uye anodzorera chitarisiro chechirwere "
"nevhoti yechivimbo."

#: .\templates\landing\services.html:274
msgid "3. Get Recommendations"
msgstr "3. Wana Mazano"

#: .\templates\landing\services.html:275
msgid ""
"Receive treatment suggestions, quarantine steps, and preventive advice "
"tailored to the result."
msgstr ""
"Gashira mazano ekurapa, nhanho dzekuchengetwa, uye mazano edziviriro "
"akagadziridzirwa mhedzisiro."

#: .\templates\landing\services.html:281
msgid "4. Connect with Vets"
msgstr "4. Bata nhevedzo neveti"

#: .\templates\landing\services.html:282
msgid ""
"For severe cases, select a vet from your region and request professional "
"consultation."
msgstr ""
"Kune nyaya dzakakomba, sarudza veti kubva mundunhu yako uye kumbira "
"kubvunzana kweprofession."

#: .\templates\landing\services.html:292
msgid "Who We Serve"
msgstr "Vanotarisirwa nesu"

#: .\templates\landing\services.html:293
msgid ""
"Farmers, veterinarians, and the Ministry of Agriculture—all in one ecosystem."
msgstr "Varimi, vadokotela vemhuka, uye Munisitiri weZembe—zvose pamwe chete."

#: .\templates\landing\services.html:298
#: .\templates\ministry\base_ministry.html:135
#: .\templates\ministry\dashboard.html:997 .\templates\vets\vet_base.html:125
msgid "Farmers"
msgstr "Varimi"

#: .\templates\landing\services.html:299
msgid ""
"Register for free, submit cases, get AI predictions and treatment advice, "
"and connect with vets when you need expert help. Track your case history and "
"protect your herd."
msgstr ""
"Nyoresa mahara, tumira nyaya, wana zvitarisiro zveAI uye mazano ekurapa, uye "
"bata nhevedzo neveti kana uchida rubatsiro rwenyanzvi. Tevedzera nhoroondo "
"yenyaya yako uye chengetedza mhomho yako."

#: .\templates\landing\services.html:305
#: .\templates\ministry\base_ministry.html:139
#: .\templates\ministry\dashboard.html:1002
msgid "Veterinarians"
msgstr "Vadokotela veMhuka"

#: .\templates\landing\services.html:306
msgid ""
"Apply to join our network. Get matched with farmers in your area, respond to "
"consultation requests, and access disease trend data. Ministry-approved and "
"verified."
msgstr ""
"Isa chikumbiro kujoinisa netiweki yedu. Bvumirwa kusvikana nevarimi mundunhu "
"yako, pindura zvikumbiro zvekubvunzana, uye svika paruzivo rwezvakajairika "
"zvezvirwere. Yakabvumidzwa uye yakasimbiswa neMinistry."

#: .\templates\landing\services.html:312
msgid "Ministry of Agriculture"
msgstr "Munisitiri weZembe"

#: .\templates\landing\services.html:313
msgid ""
"Use the dashboard to monitor outbreaks, view maps and analytics, manage vet "
"approvals, and export data for policy and vaccination planning."
